'''Archfiend Dice''' are an {{Epic}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Archfiend Dice''' are an {{o|e|no=y}} drop obtained from the [[Inferno Demonlord]] {{SlayerTier|III}}+ with {{Coll|Blaze Slayer 4}}. They have a {{Green|1.08%}} chance to drop from {{Stier|3}} Bosses, and a {{Green|1.02%}}  chance to drop from {{Stier|4}} Bosses.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|rarity = epic
|item_ability_name = Try Your Luck
|item_ability_activation = Right Click
|item_ability_description = Costs {{Gold|666.7k}} coins to roll between 1-6. <br> Gain between {{Red|-120❤}} and {{Red|+120❤}} for {{Green|24h}}. <br> {{Dark Gray|Overwritten by new rolls!}} <br><br> If you roll a {{Red|6}}, earn {{Gold|15M}} coins but lose this dice. <br> {{DarkGray|Heavy in the hand. Could someone have tampered with it?}}
}}
To use an '''Archfiend Dice''', it costs {{c|666,666}}. It will roll, and land on a number between 1 and 7. The player can gain between {{stat|hp|+120}} and {{stat|hp|-120}}. This effect lasts for {{Green|24 hours}}.

The dice first attempts to roll for a 7 ({{Chance|0.015%|1|6,666|rolls}}, can be buffed {{Green|2x}}–{{Green|3x}} by {{NPCSprite|Vincent}}). If this fails, it attempts to roll for a 6 ({{Chance|4.17%|1|24|rolls}}). If this fails too, it rolls for a number between 1 and 5 with equal chances.

If the dice lands on a {{Red|6}}, the player gains {{C|15M}}, but loses the dice. If the dice lands on a {{Red|7}}, the player gains an {{Item|Archfiend Dye}}, but loses the dice.

