==Notes==
*The dice can be used even without {{Coll|Blaze Slayer 4}}.

== Trivia ==
*The poll former admin {{RN|mvp+|Minikloon}} made on the 26th of February 2022 on gambling most likely helped inspire this item.<ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/scientific-poll.4839862/</ref>
*Its description implies that the dice is rigged not in favor of the player.
*The dice have negative [[w:expected value|expected value]].
{{:Sinful Dice/Dice Trivia}}

